{"title":"2012 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 2c","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2012 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2c&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Determine all pairs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/f/adfd9ae8a3fac031d3b8b470a52a709a23d4d6d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x, y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"44\" height=\"20\" /> that satisfy the system of equations\n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/a/1ca2c95be2871904d973edf1d1fd6075c9d7664c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + y = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"75\" height=\"16\" /></center>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/9/6a94b044ea092abd60b269d45192aabf08e6de98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{2} - y = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"85\" height=\"20\" /></center>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2c&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From the first equation, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/2/be2bc72efbbf46daa945c29d82ebd987540e0e3d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 0 - y = -y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"125\" height=\"17\" />. Plugging this into the second equation, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/b/f9b9421126e77206dd74fb8ad9e1fc0abf20da7f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-y)^{2} - y = y^{2} - y = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"185\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/a/b7af5c69103eae978e12d6d00746b307988651e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y(y - 1) = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"100\" height=\"20\" />, which we can see is satisfied if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/d/b8db1c24a6c4d0ade195b8b098cfe96a64267735.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/a/4fa788414e743bf2c9d1c4148ed5b19a10e616ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"56\" height=\"15\" />, which can easily be shown through the factors of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>If one doesn't notice this, then we can also factor or use the quadratic formula after moving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to the left-hand side.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/a/9aae75ac720f585c87cbaee30acefbf39bec9ff1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^{2} - y - 2 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"115\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/a/62a76677add1d246708c86edfc7c4b8a40184914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> multiply to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/a/62a76677add1d246708c86edfc7c4b8a40184914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> and sum to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />, so we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/a/32a0e53c3140d7ea79053f3b7a1f04104b959c8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^{2} - 2y + y - 2 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"156\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/2/2a2c8d6a0e676ae411ec95c3a9de85d5fe24dc77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y(y - 2) + 1(y - 2) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"186\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/e/7dee75dd2ba5f755bbf7e9cb0c5dc8562bce7203.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(y + 1)(y - 2) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"145\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>This means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/6/2a68b977288eec0010b2aa8c6ed5f5ce2170c180.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y + 1 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"76\" height=\"17\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/d/89d16460563f6bc00a526cd7bb11122d1c60bb72.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y - 2 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"76\" height=\"17\" />. From this, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/d/b8db1c24a6c4d0ade195b8b098cfe96a64267735.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/a/4fa788414e743bf2c9d1c4148ed5b19a10e616ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"56\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/d/b8db1c24a6c4d0ade195b8b098cfe96a64267735.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/8/a488b51b6c6c14b3791f6938946961fa31c39dd1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = -y = -2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"108\" height=\"17\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/a/4fa788414e743bf2c9d1c4148ed5b19a10e616ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"56\" height=\"15\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/1/d81a355d27be891dc233c3d4d72d4aa64741d810.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = -y = -(-1) = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"169\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, the pairs are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/c/70c725e3e07c77c524792e50329694985217cfd0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(-2, 2)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"68\" height=\"32\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/a/f1a75254429fbfc840cf446e5b99faa8eb4c77b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(1, -1)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"68\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2c&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Adding the two equations, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/8/c1837bb9c8251b8bc3c8708c7f9ad8f10c3d7cf4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 - y + x + y = 2 + 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"181\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/c/0ecbe1fc1b21b60066742b434cb5b931780b09d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 + x = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"86\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/f/54f9ee51444988f37ac3a43f79f4517deab96aee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{2} + x - 2 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"114\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> multiply to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/a/62a76677add1d246708c86edfc7c4b8a40184914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> and sum to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/0/1d0f7251c8e31f21e6e0332dde52bcbe56c39487.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{2} + 2x - x - 2 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"159\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/c/4bc55ba49e89a96e23ffba289950b72806316525.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x(x + 2) - 1(x + 2) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"189\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/3/28315344804aec46f069a011db48ebc9dc79c7f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x - 1)(x + 2) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"147\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/3/34310f2f36ed6d724838edb08788ee62acb33386.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/6/f361efa9ea92a34219e05e0825907161f273f17a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = -2$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>Plugging in each value into the first equation, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/a/59aa32b0cb1f3cbb29c392d3a2ee8330f8b8fd46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + y = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"76\" height=\"17\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/c/59ce50e1d8f6f40ee3cc260164ebc3b75e9ddbde.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2 + y = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"90\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/d/f5d52c265225dc0ff9edd7a98311970683c91ac5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 0 - 1 = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"124\" height=\"17\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/6/6d667cc3b894d70183aa3787231307bdea66a355.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 0 + 2 = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"109\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>From our <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> values, the possible pairs are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/c/70c725e3e07c77c524792e50329694985217cfd0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(-2, 2)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"68\" height=\"32\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/a/f1a75254429fbfc840cf446e5b99faa8eb4c77b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(1, -1)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"68\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017230416\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.022 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.036 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 213/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 8641/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.821      1 2012_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2\n100.00%    5.821      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36052:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017230416 and revision id 279738. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}